+# Intent: M7 public footprint
+
+Status: draft.
+
+| Field | Value |
+| --- | --- |
+| ID | INT-08 |
+| Status | draft |
+| Author (originator) | <DECIDE_AT_M0: product owner name> |
+| Product owner | <DECIDE_AT_M0: name> |
+| Tech lead | <DECIDE_AT_M0: name> |
